{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Man. One Jetpack. One big climb between him and home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/0a028cce3d9168726160ba55afa4ebf2.avif?t=1762055229\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras_big/0a028cce3d9168726160ba55afa4ebf2.webp?t=1762055229 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biff is having a bad day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment, he\u2019s cruising through the stars, navigating through outer space. The next, he\u2019s crash-landed on a strange alien world, his ship in pieces, and his ticket home orbiting far above.\u00a0<br><br><strong>The Misadventures of Spaceman Biff</strong> is a punishing jetpack platformer about helping the unluckiest pilot in the galaxy get home. Armed with nothing but his trusty jetpack, your job is to help Biff scale towering mountains, navigate the wreckage of his own ship, and uncover the strange secrets of this bizarre planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.poster.avif?t=1762055229\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.webm?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.mp4?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: every jump counts\u2014because every jump is a risk. Every mistake will send you tumbling back down. And every climb will test your patience, precision, and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.poster.avif?t=1762055229\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.webm?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.mp4?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your cool, master the jetpack, and bring Biff home\u2014or will you let\u00a0gravity\u00a0win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb with skill (or luck)</strong> \u2013 Master precision jetpack jumps to scale a massive vertical world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall with style</strong> \u2013 One slip can send you hurtling back to where you started\u2026 or worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the unknown</strong> \u2013 Explore wreckage, strange landscapes, and otherworldly sights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishing, skill-based platforming with the trusty jetpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast vertical world filled with handcrafted challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and strange sights to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty modes: Easy gives unlimited save points, Medium offers a few, and Hard strips them away entirely for a pure no-checkpoint challenge - just you, Biff, and the jetpack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The joy of progress\u2026 and the agony of losing it</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951310?t=1762055229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/6466976147c7b5ccae67446e944d99ea595634ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762055229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/d997ff0dd44b54f9265b6e660345573224fdf64e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762055229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/d997ff0dd44b54f9265b6e660345573224fdf64e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762055229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4122270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Man. One Jetpack. One big climb between him and home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/0a028cce3d9168726160ba55afa4ebf2.avif?t=1762055229\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras_big/0a028cce3d9168726160ba55afa4ebf2.webp?t=1762055229 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biff is having a bad day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment, he\u2019s cruising through the stars, navigating through outer space. The next, he\u2019s crash-landed on a strange alien world, his ship in pieces, and his ticket home orbiting far above.\u00a0<br><br><strong>The Misadventures of Spaceman Biff</strong> is a punishing jetpack platformer about helping the unluckiest pilot in the galaxy get home. Armed with nothing but his trusty jetpack, your job is to help Biff scale towering mountains, navigate the wreckage of his own ship, and uncover the strange secrets of this bizarre planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.poster.avif?t=1762055229\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.webm?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/d55607c4fdfda6b63ff164d3364c69d7.mp4?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: every jump counts\u2014because every jump is a risk. Every mistake will send you tumbling back down. And every climb will test your patience, precision, and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.poster.avif?t=1762055229\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.webm?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/extras/fd56232c83b6e6e44509bd2d17564378.mp4?t=1762055229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your cool, master the jetpack, and bring Biff home\u2014or will you let\u00a0gravity\u00a0win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb with skill (or luck)</strong> \u2013 Master precision jetpack jumps to scale a massive vertical world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall with style</strong> \u2013 One slip can send you hurtling back to where you started\u2026 or worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the unknown</strong> \u2013 Explore wreckage, strange landscapes, and otherworldly sights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishing, skill-based platforming with the trusty jetpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast vertical world filled with handcrafted challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and strange sights to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty modes: Easy gives unlimited save points, Medium offers a few, and Hard strips them away entirely for a pure no-checkpoint challenge - just you, Biff, and the jetpack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The joy of progress\u2026 and the agony of losing it</p></li></ul>","developers":["Prescription Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951310/fb73ab7c92dd6f7274f0b58a5537e06878da9e19/header.jpg?t=1762055229","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951310/627831321/10d44d91492d045b9c438b331ca60efd60aaf899/1762053999/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762055227","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951310/627831321/10d44d91492d045b9c438b331ca60efd60aaf899/1762053999/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762055227","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951310/627831321/10d44d91492d045b9c438b331ca60efd60aaf899/1762053999/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762055227","id":257225692,"mp4":{"480":"https://video